/*
 * Robin walks down to the beach and offers you a glass of lemonade. You can accept and chat for a while (Robin's dialogue varies based on trauma and romance),
 *  decline, or follow Robin back to the lemonade stand.
 */
:: Fishing Robin Lemonade Give
<<set $daily.fishing.beach.robinLemonadeVisited to true>>
<<effects>>

You hear sand crunching behind you. Turning, you see Robin walking towards you with a glass of lemonade.
<br><br>

<<if $robinromance is 1>>
	"Hey! I was hoping I'd find you here!" <<nnpc_He "Robin">> gives you a quick peck on the cheek. "I spotted you from the stand. I thought you might want something." <<nnpc_He "Robin">> holds out the glass.
<<else>>
	Robin waves as <<nnpc_he "Robin">> approaches. "Hey! Caught anything good yet?" <<nnpc_He "Robin">> holds out the glass with a grin.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Accept (0:05)|Fishing Robin Lemonade Leave]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Decline|Fishing Robin Lemonade Decline]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Robin Lemonade Leave
<<effects>>

You accept the glass and take a sip. <<lstress>><<stress -3>>
<br><br>

<<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 30>>
	/* Fishing Todo Writing: You chat and robin is trauma */
<<else>>
	/* Fishing Todo Writing: You chat and robin is not trauma */
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 30>>
	<<print either(
		'Before <<nnpc_he "Robin">> leaves, Robin gives you a gentle wave. "Stay... stay safe out here, okay?"', 
		'As <<nnpc_he "Robin">> heads back, Robin looks back at you with worried eyes. "Please be careful."'
		)>>
<<elseif $robinromance is 1>>
	<<print either(
		'Before <<nnpc_he "Robin">> leaves, Robin leans in and gives you a peck on the cheek. "Good luck fishing! I\'ll see you later."',
		'<<nnpc_He "Robin">> squeezes your hand gently and smiles. "Have fun out here. Come find me when you\'re done?"',
		)>>
<<else>>
	<<print either(
		'As <<nnpc_he "Robin">> heads back toward town, Robin calls out: "See you later!"',
		'Robin waves goodbye. "Good luck out there! Catch something good!"'
		)>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Return to fishing|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Follow Robin back|Fishing Robin Lemonade Follow Back]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Robin Lemonade Decline
<<effects>>

<<if $robinromance is 1>>
	You catch a brief flash of disappointment on <<nnpc_his "Robin">> face. "Oh, okay." <<nnpc_He "Robin">> gives you a small smile. "Good luck with the fishing. I'll see you later?"
<<else>>
	Robin looks a bit disappointed, but <<nnpc_his "Robin">> smile doesn't fade. "No problem! More time for fishing, right?" <<nnpc_He "Robin">> waves as <<nnpc_he "Robin">> heads back toward the stand. "Catch something good!"
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Robin Lemonade Follow Back
<<effects>>

"Mind if I walk back with you?" you ask.
<br><br>

Robin's face lights up. "I'd really like that."
<br><br>
<<link [[Head to <<nnpc_his "Robin">> stand|Robin's Lemonade]]>><<set $phase to "fishingWalk">><</link>>
